=== Glass Unit ===
id: services.botPersonality
version: 0.1.0
language: typescript

=== Intent ===
purpose: Generate personality-driven responses for habit check-ins, journal reminders, Telegram interactions, and accountability insights. Supports four bot personalities (encouraging, drill_sergeant, chill, coach) with AI-generated responses via Claude Haiku, static template messages for latency-sensitive interactions, and journal-aware accountability analysis. Exports sanitizeForPrompt and PERSONALITY_PROMPTS for use by other modules.
source:
  kind: prd
  reference: "Bot Personality & Streak-Aware Responses — Personality Service"
parent: index
stakeholder: user
subIntents: []
approvalStatus: approved

=== Contract ===
requires:
  - "Valid Anthropic API key for AI-generated responses"
  - "Streak data computed via services.streaks"
guarantees:
  on_success:
    - "generateHabitResponse returns a personality-appropriate message after habit yes/no"
    - "generateJournalReminderMessage returns a personality-appropriate journal reminder"
    - "Encouraging personality: warm, supportive, celebratory on success, gentle on failure"
    - "Drill Sergeant personality: grudging acknowledgment on success, aggressive on failure, no expletives"
    - "Chill/Zen personality: calm, serene, non-judgmental, mindful observations"
    - "Coach personality: firm but supportive, goal-oriented, strategic"
    - "AI responses use claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 with max_tokens: 100, temperature: 0.8"
    - "Static fallback functions return template responses when AI unavailable"
    - "getStaticHabitResponse returns a reasonable response without AI"
    - "getStaticJournalReminder returns a reasonable reminder without AI"
    - "getStaticEntrySavedAck returns personality-specific entry acknowledgment (no AI call)"
    - "getStaticTranscriptionCompleteMsg returns personality-specific transcription status"
    - "getStaticCancelMsg returns personality-specific check-in cancel message"
    - "getStaticInvalidResponseMsg returns personality-specific invalid input message"
    - "getStaticCleanupOffer returns personality-specific habit cleanup offer"
    - "getStaticCleanupResponse returns personality-specific cleanup result message"
    - "getStaticCheckinSummaryLine returns personality-specific check-in summary"
    - "getStaticCheckinIntro returns personality-specific check-in intro with habit count"
    - "generateAccountabilityInsight returns journal-aware accountability observation or null"
    - "sanitizeForPrompt exported for use by other modules"
    - "PERSONALITY_PROMPTS exported for use by other modules"
  on_failure:
    - "AI failures fall back to static template responses"
    - "API errors do not propagate — always returns a string"
    - "generateAccountabilityInsight returns null on failure (no static fallback)"
invariants:
  - "Response length kept under 100 tokens (~75 words) for habit/journal AI"
  - "Accountability insight limited to 150 max_tokens"
  - "Bot personality is separate from journal polish voiceStyle"
  - "Each habit answer triggers at most one AI call"
  - "Static functions make zero AI calls — suitable for latency-sensitive paths"
fails:
  ApiError: "Fall back to static template"
  RateLimited: "Fall back to static template"
